// Bounded startup run for docs/test/game-infrastructure.md TC-074.
//
// Read by Bevy's `bevy_ci_testing` plugin via the CI_TESTING_CONFIG
// environment variable, and only reachable through the client's `ci_testing`
// feature, which is never enabled for shipped builds.
//
// The frame budget is what bounds the run: the startup barrier resolves in well
// under a second, and its own timeout releases it after 5s of real time even if
// every read fails, so 600 frames leaves ample room without letting a hung
// process sit in CI.
(
    setup: (
        fixed_frame_time: Some(0.016666667),
    ),
    events: [
        (600, AppExit),
    ],
)
